<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes-1.The above results reviewed by the AuditCommittee &amp; approved by the BOD on 26-06-2020.2. NCLT approved the Composite Scheme (the Scheme),vide its order dated 15-01-2020,effective from 12-02-2020,Appointed dateis 1-10-2018.Pursuant to Scheme: a.VGWL,FIFPL&amp;GBL amalgamated with BGWL,since renamed as Borosil Renewables Ltd.b.Scientific &amp; Industrial products &amp; Consumer products businesses of BGWL &amp; VGWL along with its investment(including investments in subsidiaries)(“DemergedUndertakings”)demerged into Borosil Ltd then WOS of BGWL.c.49,62,280 Eq. Shares of Re.1/-each of the Co. held by FIFPL stood cancelled. 48,14,804 Eq. Shares &amp; 76,14,434 Eq. shares allotted on fair value basis to shareholders of VGWL &amp; FIFPL respectively in the ratio of 200 Eq. shares of Re.1/- each fully paid up against 81 Eq. shares of Rs.10/- each fully-paid up of VGWL &amp; 200 Eq. shares of Re.1/-each fully paid up against 109 Eq. shares of Rs. 10/- each fully-paid up of FIFPL held by them on the record date 1 i.e. 18-02-2020 for this purpose. 1,41,91,557 Eq. Shares allotted at par to the shareholders of GBL  in the ratio of 1 Eq. shares of Re. 1/- each fully paid up against 2 Eq. shares of Rs. 5/- each fully-paid up held by them on the aforesaid record date.In addition, 1022 shares issued as fraction entitlement.These makes total allotment of equity shares to 2,66,21,817.Above resulted into increase in Paid up Capital by Rs 216.60 lakhs &amp;recognition of Securities Premium of Rs. 33,310.35 lakhs.d.BorosilAfrasiaFZE,KlassPackLtd,BorosilTechnologiesLtd&amp;AcalyphaRealtyLtd ceased to be subsidiaries of the Co..e.Scheme has been accounted for as per the accounting treatment read with applicable accounting standards prescribed under Sec133 of Companies Act.f.Demerged undertakings:-All assets &amp; liabilities of the demerged undertakings have been de-recognized at their respective carrying values with the net differential amount of Rs.10,046.03 lakhs on such de-recognition being adjusted to the Capital Reserve.-Above demerger considered as discontinued operations from 1-10-2018,as prescribed under IndAs105.Results of discontinued operations are as under: (Rs.InLakhs)Sr.no.  Particulars Year ended - 31.03.2019 1 Total Revenue-17,775.49 2 Total Exps-14,298.25 3 Profit before exceptional items &amp; tax (1-2)-3,477.24 4 Exceptional items - - 5 Profit before tax (3+4)- 3,477.24 6 Tax Exps -1,206.96 7 Profit from discontinued operations(5-6)-2,270.28 g.Amalgamation of VGWL, FIFPL&amp;GBL&amp;demerger of demerged undertakings resulted into net negative capital reserve of Rs.4,620.69 lakhs after adjustment of retained earnings of Rs.27,606.91 lakhs.3.The outbreak of COVID19 virus continues to spread across the globe including India &amp; has caused significant disruption of businesses including our Co.Initially,Co had to shut down its hot end production lines/furnaces &amp; put them on soak till23-04-2020 in its plant in Bharuch.Registd Offi. in Mumbai has been also shut down in the last week of March 2020. This to some extent impacted financial results for the quarter ended 31-03-2020.After One furnace remaining shutdown for nearly 2 months,now both furnaces are operational.In assessing the recoverability of Co.’s assets such as Trade receivable,Inventories,Invt etc.,the Co. has considered internal &amp; external info. upto the date of approval of these financial results &amp; expects to recover the carrying amt of the assets. 4.In view of business uncertainties owing to COVID19 &amp; in order to conserve resources &amp; to invest in future growth,the BOD do not recommend any dividend for the FY ended31-03-2020. 5.During the quarter,Mr.Ramaswami Pillai&amp; Mr.Ashok Jain have been appointed as a WTD &amp;Mr.Sunil Roongta&amp; Mr.Kishor Talreja have been appointed as CFO &amp; CS of the Co. respectively.6.Figures for the corresponding previous period/year have been rearranged/regrouped/restated by the mng. in view of the Scheme as detailed in Note2.The figures for the quarter ended31-03-2020 are the balancing figures.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
